  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your inner strength to suppress pain and recover from injury.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Godless Healing<sup>ISWG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat even if you have more than half your hit points, adding your mythic tier to your Hit Dice to determine the amount of damage cured. If you are half your hit points or below, you heal twice the normal amount of damage. If you are at 0 hit points or below, you can use this feat on your turn without taking an action, curing three times the normal amount. If you are affected by a pain effect when you use this feat, you can attempt a new saving throw to end the effect. If the effect does not allow a save, the remaining duration of the effect is halved (minimum 1 round).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
